          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehazi aramwishura ati: “Ni amahoro. Databuja antumye kukubwira ko hari babiri bo mu biga ibijanye no kuvugishwa bavuye mu mitumba yo mu ntara ya Efurayimu bamugendeye. None ngo bahe italanto imwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 34.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " y’ifeza n’imyambaro ibiri y’impuzu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
