          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani amubwira amwinginga ati: “Ahubwo nutware italanto zibiri.” Aca afata italanto zibiri azihambirira hamwe azishira mu mufuko, amuhana n’imyambaro ibiri y’impuzu, aca abiha abakozi biwe babiri ngo babitware bitangire imbere Gehazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bageze ku mpinga y’umusozi, Gehazi aca asaba ba bakozi za ngabire bari bazanye azinyegeza i muhira iwe, aca arabarungika basubira inyuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
